  "body": "An operation named `Sq #1 [die] \\x` posts as `(Sq #1 [die] \\x - Wire Contour)`. The Sodick owner's notes: comments must not contain escape characters, hashes or square brackets. The post's `clean()` strips only `()%;/` and non-ASCII. Evidence: `out/edm-test-square-comment-test-sodick.nc`.\n\nDone means: the Sodick post removes or replaces `#`, `[`, `]` and `\\` in every comment it writes; pinned by a golden.\n\nFound in a wire EDM validation run of CamCraft 0.24.0 through the camcraft MCP (2026-11-21), on test parts in `~/Desktop/camcraft/edm-validation/` (EDM-T1 square, EDM-T2 2-axis block, EDM-T3 taper block) and a Sodick owner's own UV part (spikeypineapple, #617). Wire EDM-W025 (0.25 mm), Sodick ALC400G with test conditions.",
